    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d48">

                <pb facs="0072" n="63" sameAs="frus:frus1940v02/pg63"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00112 Wood Pulp/18: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in the United
                        Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kennedy</hi>)<anchor n="60"
                        xml:id="d48-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-05-31T15:00:00-04:00">May 31, 1940—3
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1041. With reference to our telegram of today<anchor n="61" xml:id="d48-f2"/>
                    regarding Swedish wood pulp we have been informed by the Finnish Minister that
                    the Finnish Legation in London is being instructed to consult with you in
                    connection with representations which the Legation will make to the British
                    Government with a view to facilitating the passage of vessels bound for the
                    United States from Finland. We understand that four Finnish vessels are now
                    loading and will be ready to sail for the United States within a few days.</p>
                <p>Because of the United States interests involved you are authorized to associate
                    yourself with the representations of your Finnish colleague limiting yourself,
                    however, to expressing the hope that the passage of the cargoes will be
                    facilitated.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d48-f1" n="60" type="source" xml:id="d48-f1-content">
                <p>The same, <hi rendition="#italic">mutatis mutandis</hi>, as No. 1445 on the same
                    date to the Chargé in Germany.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d48-f2" n="61" xml:id="d48-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram No. 1042, 4 p.m., <hi rendition="#italic">infra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
